    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Forfeited Upon Expulsion</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A policy status that occurs when coverage ends due to expulsion from a group or organization. Induced from a Hierarchy placement via graph-native parent (entity role co-occurrence): subClassOf BENEFIT; cluster of 2 surfa…</rdfs:comment>
