    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Specifies the definition of the Common Reporting Standard (CRS) as outlined in the CRS OECD Framework, which governs the reporting obligations and compliance requirements for financial institutions. Assigned domain=CRSRe…</rdfs:comment>
