    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Indexed Whole Life</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A life insurance policy with cash value growth linked to a market index. Induced from a Placed as subClassOf LifeInsuranceProduct (Stage 5, confidence: high); cluster of 3 surface variant(s) merged in Stage 3.</rdfs:comment>
