    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Liability cap applies within first two years. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence specifies that liability under IDE is limited to the first two years, linking the rate to a time-bound policy duration…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Specifies a formula for account values without limits. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The rate governs credit calculation for accounts. Evidence confirms 'Account' as the range and 'Rate' as the domain of the…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Applies a cap to the return amount under specified conditions. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The property applies a cap to returns, which are governed by a Rate. The evidence confirms that returns are capped…</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A percentage value applied to calculate financial amounts in an insurance contract.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/insurance#RecurringCost"/>
