    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A payment made by an institution on behalf of a policyholder for life insurance premiums. Induced from a Placed as subClassOf PremiumPayment (Stage 5, confidence: high); cluster of 2 surface variant(s) merged in Stage 3.</rdfs:comment>
