    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A commitment to comply with CRS information exchange obligations. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence shows institutional compliance with CRS reporting, and the edge topology links institutions to com…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Annual tax counsel consultation required. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The policyholder must consult tax counsel annually, which is a mandatory disclosure requirement. This supports a someValuesFrom restric…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A policy must comply with CVAT requirements. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The property mandates compliance with CVAT rules, which are regulatory requirements. The evidence confirms that the death benefit mu…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Access requires prospectus review. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence mandates reviewing the prospectus before allocation, so access is contingent on regulatory disclosure. The property correctly lin…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A claim or dispute must be resolved through binding arbitration. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence states disputes must be submitted to binding arbitration, which requires documentation. This implie…</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A payment made by an institution on behalf of a policyholder for life insurance premiums.</skos:definition>
