    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Suicide benefits are excluded within a specified time. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The policy includes a suicide exclusion window that applies within two years of issue or reinstatement. The property links…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Maintains direct pay status during provider switch. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence confirms that direct monthly billing remains stable during provider switching. This implies the policy must have…</rdfs:comment>
