    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">All beneficiaries receive identical shares of the cash value. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence shows equal distribution among beneficiaries, implying that all shares must be of type PercentageAlloc…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Any policy modification must be preceded by a 90-day notice. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence mandates a 90-day notice before modifications, which is a procedural requirement. The domain is LifeIns…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Each policy grants exactly one vote. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The sentence explicitly states one vote per policy, and the edge topology confirms the relationship between Policy and VotingRights. The car…</rdfs:comment>
