    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Surrender charges are enforced even if the policyholder is a senior citizen. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The property enforces surrender charges regardless of the policyholder's status. The evidence confir…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An index sponsor cannot be held liable under the policy terms. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; Organization is a superclass of IndexSponsor, and Exclusion is a distinct class. They share no common subclass in…</rdfs:comment>
