  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/insurance#Claim">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Claim</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A formal request for benefits under a life insurance policy. Induced from a Placed as subClassOf owl:Thing (Stage 5, confidence: high); cluster of 6 surface variant(s) merged in Stage 3.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Time-based constraints on claim or payment events. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence specifies claim payment timelines (e.g., 30 days). The property links claims to time periods, making TimePeriod t…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Benefits denied due to intoxication. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The property explicitly excludes benefits when intoxication causes death, and the classes are disjoint by definition in the domain of claim…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A claim must be approved before payment. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence states claim approval precedes payment, and payment discharges liability. This links the claim process to a charge absorpti…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A claim requires specific documentation to be submitted for processing. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence lists multiple required documents for claims, such as death certificates and forms. The prop…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Settlement option cannot be changed once selected. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence states that once monthly income payments begin, the settlement option cannot be changed, implying a disjoint rela…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Claims for unapproved escalation events are denied. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence states that claims arising from unapproved escalation events are denied. This establishes a direct link between…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">AD&amp;D claims require a police report submission. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence explicitly states that a police report is required for AD&amp;D claims, making it a mandatory documentation requirement.…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A claim must have a release from the assignee before processing. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence states a release from the assignee is required to process a claim, indicating that every claim must…</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A formal request for benefits under a life insurance policy.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/insurance#LifeInsurancePolicy"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="ncb598afe76e6469cba597494ddb7b313b45"/>
