  <rdf:Description rdf:about="https://example.org/ontology/insurance#Policyholder">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Policyholder</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An individual who holds and is responsible for a life insurance policy. Induced from a Placed as subClassOf PolicyOwner (Stage 5, confidence: high); cluster of 1 surface variant(s) merged in Stage 3.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Specifies conditions for policyholder conversion rights. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence shows conversion privileges are tied to eligibility conditions for policyholders, with clear links to 'Conv…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Minimum 25 work hours weekly. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence specifies a 25-hour weekly threshold for eligibility. The cardinality 25 matches 'Employees who work 25 or more hours per week are eli…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Policyholder must undergo annual recertification to maintain eligibility. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence shows annual recertification is required for policyholder eligibility, linked to classific…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Policyholder gets premium return on survival. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence confirms that surviving to a specified anniversary triggers a return of premium, directly linking the policyholder to…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Premiums waived upon total disability. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; Evidence confirms that meeting total disability criteria triggers a premium waiver, directly linking the policyholder to the waiver benefi…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Notify insurer of residence change to maintain eligibility. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence links failure to notify to compliance review and eligibility loss. The requirement is tied to exclusion…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Policy validity depends on visa status. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence shows that visa status affects policy validity, and the domain is the policyholder. The property 'requiresNoticePeriodForMod…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">No fee for monthly EFT conversion. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence indicates that converting to monthly EFT incurs no fee, and the domain is the policyholder. The property 'allowsPremiumPaymentCes…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Mandatory payment under specified conditions. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence shows that timely payments are required, including restrictions on payment sources. The property 'requiresPaymentOfOve…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Policyholder must notify insurer of occupational change. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence specifies a mandatory notification requirement upon occupational change, with documentation needed. This al…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Policyholder must provide annual certification to maintain eligibility. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; Evidence shows annual health or wellness certification is required for eligibility. The property links po…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Policyholder has right to litigate death benefit disputes. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence confirms policyholders can litigate disputes over death benefits. The property connects policyholders to…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Policyholders must receive notice before rate changes. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence mandates written notice before rate adjustments, and the property applies to policyholders. The range 'Notice…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Qualifies for reduced paid-up insurance. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence describes conditions under which the option is available. The property links policyholder to a condition, so someValuesFrom…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Policyholder may convert after master policy cancellation. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence confirms that a policyholder has a conversion right when the master policy is canceled, linking the polic…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Acceleration payments are not repayable. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence states that acceleration payments are not repayable, indicating they are a type of payment interval. The domain is the poli…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Estate is default beneficiary if none designated. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The property defines the estate as the default beneficiary when no valid beneficiary is specified. Evidence confirms this rule…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Policyholder must submit annual reports to maintain coverage. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence shows that annual reporting is required under IRC §6039I for policies exceeding $500,000, making it a…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Policyholder must satisfy FATCA reporting obligations. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence mandates FATCA reporting for US financial accounts held by foreign nationals. This requires the policyholder…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Policy acceptance depends on health disclosures. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The property links policy acceptance to health disclosures made by the policyholder. HealthRepresentation is the correct range a…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A charitable beneficiary must remain valid throughout the policy term. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence indicates that the charitable beneficiary's eligibility must persist throughout the policy te…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Policyholder must elect portability by deadline. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; Elections must be made within 31 or 90 days of termination or death, defining a time-bound eligibility condition; source cluster…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A policyholder is guaranteed to pay the same premium for life. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence confirms that the policyholder is guaranteed a fixed premium for life, which is a monetary value. Thi…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Policyholder responsible for draft failure consequences. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence specifies that the policyholder remains responsible for timely payment even if notice is not received, impl…</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">An individual who holds and is responsible for a life insurance policy.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/insurance#PolicyOwner"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:nodeID="ncb598afe76e6469cba597494ddb7b313b7"/>
