    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Must meet HbA1c stability threshold to be eligible. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence requires HbA1c to be stable at or below 7.5% for 12 months, which constitutes a documented health eligibility cr…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Activates a diabetes-related exclusion in the policy. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The property indicates that a diabetes-related exclusion is triggered by the insured's condition. The domain is InsuredIndi…</rdfs:comment>
