    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Full benefit payable upon graduation. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The property links a beneficiary to a percentage-based benefit that is payable upon graduation. The evidence shows the benefit is expressed…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A policyholder must obtain consent before certain actions can be taken. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence indicates that consent is required before certain actions, such as policy surrender, and tha…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">A time period during which a policyholder may elect charitable redirection of benefits. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The property defines a time window for charitable elections. The evidence specifies a 90-…</rdfs:comment>
    <skos:definition xml:lang="en">A beneficiary entitled to a specific portion of a life insurance policy's payout.</skos:definition>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="https://example.org/ontology/insurance#Beneficiary"/>
