    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">LTC benefits cease upon recovery from qualifying condition. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence shows LTC benefits reduce the LTC Benefit Pool dollar-for-dollar. The property 'reducesPool' captures th…</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Long-term care claims reduce net risk over time. Induced via Stage 6 restriction induction; The evidence shows LTC claims directly reduce net amount at risk. The property links LTCBenefit to NetAmountAtRisk as the affect…</rdfs:comment>
