    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An individual with formal authority to approve and execute life insurance contract actions. Induced from a Hierarchy placement via graph-native parent (entity role co-occurrence): subClassOf ROLE; cluster of 1 surface va…</rdfs:comment>
