    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">An endorsement that allows flexible investment choices within a life insurance policy. Induced from a Placed as subClassOf Rider (Stage 5, confidence: high); cluster of 1 surface variant(s) merged in Stage 3.</rdfs:comment>
