    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">Triggers Monthly Access</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Indicates that a specific condition or event leads to the granting of monthly access rights to a designated resource or benefit. Assigned domain=PaymentFrequency, range=LimitationOnLiabilityAfterSelfInflictedDeath; This…</rdfs:comment>
